## Verification Gate

The single local and CI gate is:

```bash
bash scripts/verify.sh
```

It runs formatting, workspace check, tests, clippy with warnings denied, fake-ready checks, scaffold promotion checks, dependency boundary checks, example compile/test smoke, and the runtime smoke script.

